{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午9時，天文台錄得26.0°C，相對濕度59%。</p><p>一股達強風程度的東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。</p><p>受東北季候風及天文大潮影響，預料本港今晚（28日）水位比正常稍高，個別沿岸低窪地區可能出現輕微水浸。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T02:01:29.584577+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T01:20:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T04:38:14.926255+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T01:58:25.404828+00:00","content_hash":"204bdae9b6ba75b755db30a35dc86fb46ffd32d1dada21f25cd5754a69588e3d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}